TERRAFORM (State, Drift & Production Scenarios)

These scenarios reflect real infrastructure failures, IaC mistakes, and interview trap questions.

⸻

🧱 Terraform – Real-World DevOps Scenarios
 1. Terraform apply fails halfway. What happens to your infrastructure and how do you recover?
 2. Infrastructure was changed manually in the cloud console. How do you detect and fix state drift?
 3. Your Terraform state file got deleted or corrupted. What do you do?
 4. Multiple team members are running Terraform simultaneously. How do you prevent conflicts?
 5. How do you manage multiple environments (dev, qa, prod) using Terraform?
 6. A resource was accidentally deleted from Terraform code but still exists in cloud. What happens on apply?
 7. How do you safely destroy only one resource without impacting others?
 8. Terraform plan shows unexpected changes. How do you analyze and avoid them?
 9. How do you manage secrets and sensitive data in Terraform?
 10. How do you implement rollback in Terraform?
 11. How do you version Terraform modules across teams?
 12. Terraform execution is slow. How do you optimize it?
 13. How do you migrate Terraform state from local to remote backend?
 14. A provider version upgrade breaks your infrastructure. How do you handle it?
 15. How do you enforce policies and guardrails for Terraform usage?

